Z||000007||Spektyr||04-25-2001||09:34 PM||||Hehe, I got the mother of all deals...<P>$100 for an 85GT with 108k on the clock, recent major tune-up, minor transmission problem.  The guy I bought it from is a friend of mine, was tired of getting the car fixed (expensive since he can't fix cars).  A simple C-clip later I had the tranny working fine.<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||12
